  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting  a Stable Federation in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The engagement is expected to deliver regular, high-quality contextual and political analysis to inform donor engagement and facilitate dialogue and coordination among key stakeholders.

It will provide flexible, demand-driven support to the Transitional Puntland Election Commission and remain adaptable to evolving political and security dynamics. Overall, the engagement aims to contribute to credible local elections and broader democratic processes, thereby supporting improved governance.</narrative>
  </description>
